    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The city’s name means “city of the world,” a meaning attributed by James Phillips in 1853.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        8
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cosmopolis%2C_Washington"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "A lumber mill opened in 1881, grew into a major employer, and the town incorporated as a town in 1891.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
