      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cosmopolis%2C_Washington"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Northern Pacific Railway built a spur through Cosmopolis in 1892, linking it to Tacoma via a bridge over the Chehalis River.",
